Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:05.40,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:05.88,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,820,4380,5300)\pos(635.932,338.545)}Episode 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:05.88,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,820,4380,5300)\pos(635.932,543.818)}Sir Zhūgě Prays for Winds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:11.03,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In November of the 13th year of the Jian'an era, 208 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:14.09,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the Sun and Liu allied, resisting the Cao army together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:17.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu finalized his Fire Stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, in the season of midwinter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:22.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,how could there be southeast winds?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:26.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When Zhou Yu considered that, he suddenly vomited blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He became bedridden and could not get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The decisive battle is near, \Nyet the Chief Commander has fallen ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be fortunate for Cao Cao, but it is our woe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on your words, I can cure Gongjin's ailment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:40.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(974.464,498.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,350,4280,4600)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If indeed so, then the state will be blessed greatly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:04.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(878.644,450.667)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming comes to visit you, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you have become so ill since our last meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:24.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.46,388)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Men's fortunes are fickle, \Nhow can I be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The winds and weather are fickle as well, \Nhow could they be predicted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.98,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel troubled, Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take medicine for your illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already taken it, but it had no effect whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is the fire in your heart, \Nyou have to calm your energy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your energy has calmed down, you can recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What medicine should I take to calm my energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something that can calm your energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, leave us be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:38.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(640,668.8)}"To break Cao's back, with fire we attack. \NEverything is set, save the east wind we lack!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He is truly extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you know my illness, what should I do to cure it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in a desperate situation. Please elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Commander already bears the burden of defeating the Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun and Liu are in alliance, \NI hope you will deign to tell us what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, if the southeast winds were lend to you for three days and nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,would that be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Never mind three days and three nights!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With a strong southeast wind, \Neven one night would be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could there be such a wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you want the southeast winds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to build a pavilion, call it the{\i1} Seven Star Altar{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be as high as nine feet, \Ndivided into three levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should also send 120 guards for me to assign to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I shall ascend the altar and pray for wind for three days and nights, to aid your plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seven Star Altar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,where should I build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It should be built at the foot of Mount Nanping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Close to both mountain and river, \Nthis is the area to build the altar in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The great battle is imminent, we cannot delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is too late tonight. \NTomorrow, we shall construct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall pray for the winds from the {\i1}Jiazi{\i0} day \Nuntil the{\i1} Bingyin{\i0} day, when they shall cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:51.48,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: AKA. Nov. 20 until Nov. 22. "Jiazi"(甲子) and "Bingyin"(丙寅) are both from the Sexagenary Cycle, a traditional calendar system used in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that serve you, Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:05:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sleeping Dragon! I have faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After this matter succeeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, send 500 warriors to heed Sir Kongming, and build the Seven Star Altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Also have 120 men to bear flags \Nand guard the altar, at the ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming, everything has been prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We only wait for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you may return to assist the \NChief Commander in deploying troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to march when the wind blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something else, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see each other after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why look so wistful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When I crossed the River, I was blessed to have you, Zijing, to assist me in allying Sun and Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I faced many troubles, but I could always count on Zijing to resolve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you well enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We allied against the Cao, \Nthe shared objective of our two families!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No need to stand on ceremony, my good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave orders to my troops and prepared early as well. I won't be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If it happens that the wind fails to manifest, \NI hope Chief Commander will not blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I have seen, you are a prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fully believe that you will summon the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,At this solemn ceremony, \Nmy orders shall be absolute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guards may not move without orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You are forbidden to whisper to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are forbidden to speak nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are forbidden to fuss over nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:11:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are forbidden to be distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever violates the order shall be beheaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Master Kongming has begun the ritual at the Seven Star Altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We ask sire to announce which officers shall march out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Heaven follows its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He is praying for southeast winds during midwinter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I do feel quite worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When he ascended to pray, it was with the utmost deliberation. He means to carry this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Present, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you fully recovered from the beating? Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:54.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(651.932,492)}Huáng Gài \NStyled: Gōngfù
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The beatings are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've prepared twenty flammable boats as you've instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Large nails thickly stud the ships' bows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The ships contain reeds and dry wood, which are covered with oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The oil is covered with sulfur, salt, and other things flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Each ship is covered with black-oiled cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,On the bow of each ship is an \Nazure dragon flag as required by the Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and a fast ship is attached to the stern. \NThe ships only await your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gan Ning and Kan Ze!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you, along with Cai Zhong and Cai He, shall wait at the naval camps!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to guard the naval camp! \NThe troops on land cannot enter the boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Remember this! Do not let the Cai Brothers and those that surrendered enter the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu's fleet is anchored 85 {\i1}li{\i0} \Nfrom the camp, awaiting your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, let us ascend the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:47.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All soldiers under my command...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,... are to prepare the ships, weapons, and crossbows, \Nand stand ready for orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:17:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be no delay. Anyone who violates my orders is punishable by death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Zhuge Liang fails to summon the wind, it would ruin our entire operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305.898,518.667)}Dīng Fèng \NStyled: Chéngyuān
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let others start first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, Zhuge Liang is too fond of the absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the dead of winter, how can there be wind from the southeast?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not toying with our army?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Would Zhuge Liang dare speak so lightly in the face of grave military matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We should wait for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:06.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Wind! Wind! Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The southeast wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a southeast wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is a southeast wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334}Zhuge Liang has wrested control of the very forces of Heaven and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334\pos(640,666.667)}The unpredictable methods of spirits and demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334}If we let such a man live, \Nhe will bring ruin to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.39,0:23:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334\pos(640,666.667)}What-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.81,0:23:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding Feng and Xu Sheng!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Each of you lead 100 soldiers, approach by land and water, surround the Seven Star Altar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.78,0:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Zhuge Liang without question!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring his head for your reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.66,0:23:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no! \N-Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-We can't do this! \N-Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me, we have troops to command. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But Chief Commander-!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come! Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:11.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(336.575,416.8)}Kàn Zé \NStyled: Dérùn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good! Fill it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:18.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1006.834,658.4)}Cài Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.74,0:24:28.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(299.269,662.667)}Cài Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.55,0:24:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He just came down from the altar. \NLook, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zhuge! The Chief Commander requested for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zhuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.62,0:25:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zhuge! The Chief Commander requested for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.74,0:25:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go back and tell Chief Commander to make good use of his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.82,0:25:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall go back to Xiakou for the time being. I will see him again another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.34,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, wait! Wait! I have something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:52.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.46,482.667)}Xú Shèng \NStyled: Wénxiàng
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected that Chief Commander Zhou would not tolerate me. He will surely try to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.86,0:26:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have asked Zhao Zilong to come in advance to pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.74,0:26:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, no need to pursue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, we will meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.07,0:26:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Zhao Zilong of Changshan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:17.57,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(354.953,488)}Zhào Yún \NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.27,0:26:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I received special orders to pick up the Strategos. \NWhy are you chasing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.44,0:26:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've shot an arrow to kill you, but that would damage the peace between our two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I will give you a taste of my marksmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.16,0:26:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.13,0:27:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, you have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, are the soldiers and ships at the ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They await your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.91,0:27:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please wait at the tent for assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.32,0:27:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good. \N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.74,0:27:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang and his endless schemes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.18,0:27:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,From now on, I cannot be at peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, wait until after we defeat the Cao. Then we can act against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.74,0:28:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Taishi Ci!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 soldiers directly to the borders of Huangzhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.74,0:28:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Block all of Cao's reinforcements from Hefei!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.30,0:28:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Light a fire signal; a red flag will mark the arrival of Lord Sun Quan's reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.807,469.333)}Tàishǐ Cí \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your detachment will join him and intercept Cao's routed forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.46,0:28:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.94,0:28:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.06,0:28:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Cai Zhong and Cai He now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They are drinking wine in Kan Ze's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.42,0:29:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead Cai Zhong and other surrendered generals \Nand their men to fly the banners of Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.22,0:29:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and march along the south shore, \Nstraight into Wulin!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.50,0:29:06.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936.979,513.333)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xīngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.74,0:29:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Penetrate the Cao Army grain stores \Nand light a signal fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Cai He behind in the tent. I have other uses for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.22,0:29:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Meng!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.50,0:29:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.26,0:29:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 men to the area of Wulin to assist Gan Ning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Set fire to Cao Cao's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.10,0:29:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ling Tong!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.26,0:29:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.22,0:29:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Take 3,000 men directly into Yiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.26,0:29:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Attack as soon as the fire from Wulin rises up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.06,0:29:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dong Xi!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:40.47,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.64,506.666)}Dǒng Xí \NStyled: Yuándài
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 men to take Hanyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and from the Han River, thrash Cao Cao's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.94,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Act when you see the white flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pan Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.66,0:29:50.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(331.089,469.333)}Pān Zhāng, \NStyled: Wénguī
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.02,0:29:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Take 3,000 men bearing white flags to Hanyang to support Dong Xi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.34,0:29:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.78,0:30:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, arrange your fire ships and send a messenger with a letter to Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.38,0:30:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,telling him of your "surrender" tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.30,0:30:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.06,0:30:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Han Dang, Zhou Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.18,0:30:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Qin, Chen Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.70,0:30:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.46,0:30:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of you shall lead 300 ships, \Nplacing twenty fire ships in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.02,0:30:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When you see Huang Gai's ships burning, you shall sail the fire ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.98,0:30:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and break into Cao Cao's naval camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.50,0:30:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cheng, follow me onto the deck to direct the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.70,0:30:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Xu Sheng and Ding Feng shall stay with me as guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lu Su and Kan Ze shall guard our camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.62,0:30:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.18,0:31:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.54,0:31:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.66,0:31:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 soldiers across the River into Wulin road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.38,0:31:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the dense trees and reeds, set up an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.34,0:31:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, after the fourth watch, \NCao Cao is sure to flee through this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.30,0:31:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait until half his army has passed, then set them ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though it will not kill them off fully, half of them will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.54,0:31:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos, Wulin has two roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.18,0:31:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,One leads into Nan Commandery, while the other leads into Jing Province. Which road shall I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A good question! Nan Commandery is in trouble, \Nand Cao Cao dare not go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus he will go through Jing Province, retreating to Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.14,0:31:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.62,0:31:48.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.677,516)}Zhāng Fēi \NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.42,0:31:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 men across the River to block off Yiling's roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up an ambush in Hulu Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao won't dare flee to Yiling's south, \Nbut Yiling's north.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.02,0:31:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When the rain has passed, the Cao army will be in the valley preparing rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see the smoke, set fire to the edges of the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:32:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you will not capture Cao Cao, your achievement will not be insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(370.488,481.334)}Guān Yǔ \NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi Zhu, Mi Fang, and Liu Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.50,0:32:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.38,0:32:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall each sail ships to capture the defeated soldiers and their weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.14,0:32:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.18,0:32:21.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(959.962,408)}Liú Qí
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.10,0:32:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuchang is a place of importance. Noble son, please lead your troops, and line them by the river shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.78,0:32:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After Cao Cao is defeated, there will be deserters, whom you can seize.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.70,0:32:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But do not leave the city's vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accompany sire to oversee this from the heights of Fankou.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.46,0:32:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We can witness the magnificent sight of the fire at Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.26,0:32:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and see Zhou the Youth achieve greatness!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.58,0:32:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.02,0:32:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:33:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In this major battle, all the other officers are given important tasks! Why am I left out?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.02,0:33:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, do not fret!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.02,0:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to ask you to guard one of the most important mountain passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I have some misgivings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What misgivings? Please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.02,0:33:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, Cao Cao treated you with kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.34,0:33:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When he is defeated, \Nhe will flee through Huarong Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.78,0:33:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wished to station you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.02,0:33:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I feared you would repay his \Nformer generosity by letting him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.74,0:33:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Therefore, I dared not send you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, you worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.10,0:33:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For Cao Cao's past kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.22,0:33:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I beheaded Yan Liang, slayed Wen Chou, and broke the siege at Boma. Our debts are settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.70,0:34:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if we meet each other, it would be as enemies. Why would I let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let him go, then what shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.34,0:34:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to be subject to military law!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring brush and paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.46,0:34:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cao Cao does not go through Huarong Valley, then what shall strategos do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.30,0:34:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am also subject to military law.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.06,0:35:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, hold this pledge for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.06,0:35:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.90,0:35:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When you leave, you should pile firewood on the highest hill of Huarong and set smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That would lead Cao Cao there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.58,0:35:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cao Cao sees smoke, he will suspect an ambush. Why would he come?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.02,0:35:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not heard the military theory of "using truth to deceive"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.94,0:35:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Only through this will you lure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.30,0:36:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, when you stop Cao Cao, \Nlet your feelings go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Guan Yu, am already bound by military law. \NStrategos can rest assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.98,0:36:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.02,0:36:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang has a deep sense of righteousness. If Cao Cao really passes Huarong Road,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he could let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.66,0:36:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.10,0:36:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, remember what I told you of our plan of the world divided into three?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.06,0:36:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it cannot be completed just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.26,0:36:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Cao Cao must be defeated, but we cannot kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.02,0:37:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cao Cao dies, there will be great upheaval in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sun Quan would naturally take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.82,0:37:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Therefore, unifying the Han would be unfavorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.06,0:37:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Cao Cao be destined to die, he will not reach Huarong Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is Heaven's will, even if you had another officer take charge, the future would refuse to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.66,0:37:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is so, then why have Yunchang sign a formal order?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In war, there is no room for jests.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.06,0:37:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Should Yunchang really let Cao Cao go, would this not mean his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.50,0:37:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news from Huang Gai in Jiangdong?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.66,0:37:57.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(924.115,490.666)}Xún Yōu \NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.22,0:37:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.34,0:38:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news from Cai Zhong and Cai He?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.74,0:38:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.22,0:38:09.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.356,460)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.78,0:38:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, the battle is imminent. \NEverything is prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.38,0:38:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We only wait for the news of Huang Gai. Once we march forth, we will crush and pacify Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.14,0:38:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor is brilliant and wise! The Chancellor shall win!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.98,0:38:41.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944.031,492)}Chéng Yù \NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.34,0:38:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the wind has changed direction tonight; \Nit blows from the southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.90,0:38:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334\pos(640,666.667)}Zhongde, I knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.26,0:38:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.545}A great general should first examine \NHeaven's signs, understand the geography,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.22,0:38:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334\pos(640,666.667)}and then command accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.66,0:39:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334}I won through my calculations, and failed when I did too few. Why would I act any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.98,0:39:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334}Who wouldn't know that the Winter Solstice marks a natural shift from {\i1}yin{\i0} to {\i1}yang{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.10,0:39:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334}In these times of change, what of \Na few winds blowing from the southeast?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.22,0:39:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.334\pos(640,666.667)}It is of no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, someone from Jiangdong came bearing Huang Gai's message!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.82,0:39:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.26,0:39:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir Huang has replied, and agreed to escort \Nthe supply ships to us at third watch tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.06,0:39:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His ships will bear an azure dragon flag on the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.82,0:39:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone watch for him. Are General Huang's \Nships truly coming to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.78,0:39:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Comment: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,168)}"Zhōu"

